<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab militants attacked near the Kenya-Somalia border, killing eight people, and later announced they assassinated a Somali intelligence officer in Mogadishu after a ten-year pursuit. Somali security forces opened fire on protesters in Mogadishu, killing three civilians. The Somali National Army killed senior Al-Shabaab commanders in an operation in Lower Shabelle. Somalia condemned the Mandera attack that killed eight Kenyan citizens. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1vckVTSWFfUjlTckdjNWRfNnJpMHJkdzh4aWZic09LQVFGVkNvTXlIbGtCV0x3VnZ1VHJ4VkFQb0k4ekF2OWYxQ0R5anNJdHJGaWtQcVRwYlNSLVJ6VXfSAWNBVV95cUxQcWhseEI5TFM5SlE0cnRLWTNPMTREdUhxdUwzTF9pTHhIY1FVdjBYWmZRcDVwWXVTOGJxd0k2LWduZ3ZRZ1NCaGFuUHpNa25zSWdIVlpuTVVqcGJyY055RDAwQmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQTnkxN2VqeDlrRFpXS084MVhHZFVSQzI5NDNvSmVoTDlLN3ZySXU0YTJlbThPUGh3U0U1bWpyS1BERXFqMVFrRHVhTm81a3JGbWxrcWUtdW1XSGdSd1E1NkJjYURPUWFkMGticHFNYUdhZlliSW1rel82a19qdEYxUjBtY1VJNTYtVkdhVlp1Y2tWQkdR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOVzRSVGRvenlfeGpZaEUtYzNVbHJ4OVl5RjZ0a1ZUUXBrbXRac0JDdDJpRDJKcGx2cGtBRFpieTNQYlV2VGhuZWMtZEhkdFVHWkV5OVo5YTlTakdCWnY0X1RHUE1xMWRPWU5tNjI1MFplajdHenUwZzVhZEdoV01JV0NRejUteFhLaXVqUzNYRzNqYWVFMDhCdXVB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQcUxYNHl3RC0wMzlFNjBPcHZ2NWttUFF4T0ZNeHdRYi1ZTHBjOXc3bXlmYkJvcEM0bmdjMzRnb2FrbGp4amdIMEZ5Zmx3d19pb2pYRXRtY1VhVDRLU2l3RTBiSlJabkt2OU9hbld1d3kyS1d0cHVVQVpsTmJ1RnZyUUNzTDVCdGhkT21GTkhTNVpuTE9BODJ2XzFtckw0Z3R5dnVGSkxOM2tMN0tsTTVPRzZZOXo?oc=5&quot;&gt;Мілітарний&lt;